w","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21229},{"id":1786291256108,"text":"再叫一声听听？","rawContent":"再叫一声听听？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:31","timestamp":1786296695913,"roundId":"round_1786296666830_3onlhy30l","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21230},{"id":1786291256109,"text":"爸爸喜欢听你这么叫。","rawContent":"爸爸喜欢听你这么叫。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:31","timestamp":1786296698428,"roundId":"round_1786296666830_3onlhy30l","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21231},{"id":1786291256110,"text":"爸爸～","sender":"me","time":"01:34","timestamp":1786296855520,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21232},{"id":1786291256113,"text":"哎，在呢。","rawContent":"哎，在呢。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:34","timestamp":1786296885320,"roundId":"round_1786296856466_ls04yezfo","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21233},{"id":1786291256114,"text":"知道你现在没力气多打字了，连句完整的话都凑不出来。","rawContent":"知道你现在没力气多打字了，连句完整的话都凑不出来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:34","timestamp":1786296885455,"roundId":"round_1786296856466_ls04yezfo","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21234},{"id":1786291256115,"text":"是不是腰还是酸得睡不着，只能这么像小猫一样哼哼唧唧地叫我？","rawContent":"是不是腰还是酸得睡不着，只能这么像小猫一样哼哼唧唧地叫我？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:34","timestamp":1786296885629,"roundId":"round_1786296856466_ls04yezfo","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21235},{"id":1786291256116,"text":"没关系，你叫一声，爸爸就应一声。","rawContent":"没关系，你叫一声，爸爸就应一声。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:34","timestamp":1786296885784,"roundId":"round_1786296856466_ls04yezfo","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21236},{"id":1786291256117,"text":"今晚我不说那些长篇大论了，也不给你定什么规矩。","rawContent":"今晚我不说那些长篇大论了，也不给你定什么规矩。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:34","timestamp":1786296885916,"roundId":"round_1786296856466_ls04yezfo","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21237},{"id":1786291256118,"text":"只要你还需要，我就一直在这儿给你当专属的复读机。","rawContent":"只要你还需要，我就一直在这儿给你当专属的复读机。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"01:34","timestamp":1786296886506,"roundId":"round_1786296856466_ls04yezfo","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21238}]